    "content": "I'll navigate to footer fields"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:05",
    "content": "and add a new field."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:08",
    "content": "And set the text value"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:10",
    "content": "to Stacey's doggy daycare."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:13",
    "content": "Now that's a Q pass"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:15",
    "content": "for a very cute dog."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:18",
    "content": "The very last thing to do"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:20",
    "content": "is to save our template."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:23",
    "content": "Pass Designer saves templates"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:25",
    "content": "as PK pass template files."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:29",
    "content": "I'm going to go to file,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:32",
    "content": "then save,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:33",
    "content": "and then save the template."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:38",
    "content": "Now I don't want to create"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:39",
    "content": "an individual pass"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:40",
    "content": "for every member of Stacey's doggy daycare"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:42",
    "content": "in Pass Designer."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:44",
    "content": "Instead,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:45",
    "content": "I want to personalize this template"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:47",
    "content": "at scale"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:48",
    "content": "on a server"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:49",
    "content": "using Pass Builder."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:50",
    "content": "I'm going to switch over"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:52",
    "content": "to the Swift server"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:53",
    "content": "for Stacey's doggy daycare."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:55",
    "content": "First,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:56",
    "content": "I'm going to add Pass Builder"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:57",
    "content": "as a dependency"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "10:59",
    "content": "to the Swift package manifest"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "11:00",
    "content": "and to the server target."
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "11:04",
    "content": "Now,"
  },
  {
    "timestamp": "11:05",
    "content": "I'm going to implement"
  },
